    <DataNode elementId="AT2G32010-MONOMER" textLabel="phosphatidyl inositol polyphosphate 5-phosphatase" type="Protein">
      <Xref identifier="AT2G32010-MONOMER" dataSource="plantcyc" />
      <Graphics centerX="150" centerY="335" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="pmngroup">5PTase7 has phosphatidyl inositol polyphosphate 5-phosphatase activity against |FRAME: PHOSPHATIDYL-MYO-INOSITOL-45-BISPHOSPHA a 1-phosphatidyl-1D-&lt;i&gt;myo&lt;/i&gt;-inositol 4,5-bisphosphate| with lower levels of activity against |FRAME: PHOSPHATIDYLINOSITOL-345-TRIPHOSPHATE 1-phosphatidyl-1D-myo-inositol 3,4,5-trisphosphate|. In the same assays, it shows no activity against the soluble |FRAME: INOSITOL-1-4-5-TRISPHOSPHATE D-&lt;i&gt;myo&lt;/i&gt;-inositol (1,4,5)-trisphosphate| when its activity is tested &lt;i&gt;in vitro&lt;/i&gt; following expression in insect cells |CITS: [21677096]|. A GFP-tagged 5PTase7 fusion protein accumulates in nuclear speckles, indicating that this family member might be involved in regulating gene expression at some level. The enzyme can also be found in proximity to the plasma membrane |CITS: [21677096]|. Three different &lt;i&gt;5ptase7&lt;/i&gt; mutant plants have a salt oversensitivity phenotype, likely due to a reduced production of reactive oxygen species, whereas plants over-expressing this gene show reduced salt sensivity |CITS: [21677096]|.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="AT2G32010-MONOMER" />
      <Property key="Catalyzes" value="RXN-20336, RXN-20335" />
      <Property key="CatalyzesCount" value="2" />
      <Property key="Accession1" value="AT2G32010.1" />
      <Property key="Gene" value="AT2G32010" />
      <Property key="InstanceNameTemplate" value="MONOMER-*" />
      <CitationRef elementRef="citation_PUB_21677096" />
    </DataNode>
    <DataNode elementId="AT2G37440.3" textLabel="AT2G37440.3" type="Protein">
      <Xref identifier="AT2G37440.3" dataSource="plantcyc" />
      <Graphics centerX="300" centerY="335" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
